# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment variables
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The app needs NO environment variables to run. Data is read from static JSON
# under data/seed/, so it builds and deploys with zero configuration and holds
# no secrets.
#
# This file exists to document that fact and to reserve names for likely future
# integrations. Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) only if you add one of these.
#
# Optional, future — only if you wire up a live data source that needs a key.
# CFBD_API_KEY is the variable the CollegeFootballData wrappers expect; a free
# key (1k calls/mo, or 3k/mo with an .edu email) is available at
# https://collegefootballdata.com/key  — see DATA_SOURCES.md.
# CFBD_API_KEY=
# NIL_DATA_API_KEY=
